#19043
Taxi~
A broad inset of tan leatherette breaks up the right-hand paneling beside the
passenger `wseats`x. A rubber floor mat carries a series of broad parallel
ribs, with fine dust held between them. The vehicle feels compact even while
still, every surface shaped around the practical business of carrying people.`x
~
